// Quiz for Casting
::Casting::
Which function can be used to convert a boolean to an integer in Python?
{
= int()
~ str()
~ float()
~ bool()
}

::Casting::
Which function is used for type casting in Python?
{
~ cast()
~ type_cast()
~ convert()
= int(), float(), str(), etc.
}

::Casting::
Which function can be used to convert an integer to a boolean in Python?
{
~ int()
= bool()
~ str()
~ bool(), int(), and str() all can be used
}